<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 61 0 R/E(This caf\351 website concept reimagines a Kolkata eatery through an aesthetic, ethnic lens\204blending the warmth of old Calcutta with a clean, modern interface. Inspired by the city\220s culture, textures, and everyday adda, the design highlights affordability while preserving a sense of nostalgia and charm. From visual storytelling to layout, every element reflects a balance of past and present. A dedicated contact page invites users to connect, continuing the idea of conversations over adda and a cup of tea.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[9]>>
